WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
How unsafe is it to invite outsiders?

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:03,400
I get a million-dollar annual salary from the company

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,080
Only two and a half days left in the week

4
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:07,600
The rest of the time is just idle

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,080
I'll come and clean

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,800
You can also practice datiqin in the lobby on the second floor.

7
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:12,920
Sound insulation is good here

8
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,360
Not disturbing the public at all

9
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:19,340
It turned out that I wanted to find a place to practice musical instruments that would not disturb the public.

10
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:20,620
If I give you a handful

11
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,140
Come over anytime if you want to practice piano

12
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:25,130
I'm not in the house most of the time anyway.

13
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:26,760
Boss, you are so kind

14
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,920
I promise to clean it up for you

15
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:30,320
This little girl looks innocent

16
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,480
It turns out that the method is so sophisticated

17
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,080
I got the Changzhu key directly.

18
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:36,380
It seems that in the future, more than one opponent will be in need of help.

19
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,460
It's getting late, boss

20
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:39,780
Let's go back to the dormitory first

21
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:42,220
Don't disturb your rest

22
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,300
Good night boss

23
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,420
Pay attention to safety on the road and go to bed early

24
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:53,100
Why did you come back and leave something behind?
